  "title": "Parabolic Cylinder — reference 1",
  "metadata": {
    "name": "Parabolic Cylinder — reference 1",
    "name_source": "document",
    "description": "Relier les contrôles aux ports nommés, puis lancer Run. Les types et valeurs sont explicites; sélectionner la fiche n'exécute rien.\nEntrées : argument (f64) = 0.0; order (f64) = -3.0.\nRésultats attendus : value (f64) = 0.6266570686577502.\n\nEvaluates the normalized parabolic cylinder function Dv(x), the Weber solution with Dv(z)~z^v exp(-z*z/4) at positive infinity.\n\nMode: execution. Profile: studio-draft. Capability: windows-x64; LLVM 22.1.7; exact declared scalar signature.\nExpected:\noutput-value (f64) = 0.6266570686577502\n",
    "author": "",
    "automatic_versioning": false,
    "program_version": "0.0.0.0",
